WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
In Customise, choose Add new image and select a signature image from the computer.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.500
The signature appears in Saved images. Move to the page area where it should be placed.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Choose the saved signature, then place it on the current PDF page.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Drag and resize the selected signature over the signature line.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.400
Use Image details to refine the size and position, then check the placed signature.
